| Concern | How it's handled |
|---|---|
| **Insert-only** | `_ta.isInsert` guard in the constructor; on UPDATE/DELETE the qualifying list stays empty |
| **Type filter** | Only `Customer - Direct` and `Customer - Channel` are collected; all other types (or null) are skipped |
